- Mistake (2026-11-20, evidence): the x86 scenario logs saved for the round-3 brief came from runs before the pattern fix, so the "new launcher" log showed a false failure; it nearly went to the reviewers as passing evidence. Guard: every evidence log now starts with a header line holding the sha256 of the harness and launcher it ran, and the brief cites a log only if that harness hash equals the committed harness.

